<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>smg 12 low sens</Major>
    <Description>Recoil control for SMG-12
settings used: Fov= 84
                        x= 4
                        y= 4
                        scope sens = 35
                        res = 5:4
                        sensitivity multiplier = 0.02

the recoil control may be a bit unpredictable as the smg12 does not have the same recoil always.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>        LeftDown 1
        Delay 10 ms
        MoveR 1 15
        Delay 8 ms
        MoveR -1 15
        Delay 8 ms
        MoveR 2 7   
        Delay 8 ms
        MoveR -2 7   
        Delay 7 ms
        MoveR 3 7   
        Delay 8 ms
        MoveR -3 7   
        Delay 6 ms
        MoveR 4 7   
        Delay 7 ms
        MoveR -4 7   
        Delay 6 ms
        MoveR 5 7   
        Delay 8 ms
        MoveR -5 7   
        Delay 6 ms
        LeftUp 1
      </Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>